<title>ITALY: Italy's Fondiaria director general resigns.</title>
<headline>Italy's Fondiaria director general resigns.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Italy 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The director general of Italian insurer Fondiaria, Massimo Pabis Ticci, has resigned effective from June 30, a statement from the company said.</p>
<p>Pabis Ticci joined Fondiaria in 1972 and was commercial director and vice director general prior to becoming director general.</p>
<p>Fondiaria last week announced the appointment of Roberto Gavazzi, the former head of European operations at Allianz, to the board in the place of managing director Amato Luigi Molinari.</p>
</text>
